            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, [it first tries to show suggestions from attached LSP clients](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3a354c754656538ad76d1add93ca21e75b7f3181/doc/mini-completion.txt#L18-L27).\r\n\r\n@jasonxue1, please read the help before asking questions.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3a354c754656538ad76d1add93ca21e75b7f3181/doc/mini-completion.txt#L18-L27\">it first tries to show suggestions from attached LSP clients</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/jasonxue1/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/jasonxue1\">@jasonxue1</a>, please read the help before asking questions.</p>",
