                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3a354c754656538ad76d1add93ca21e75b7f3181/doc/mini-completion.txt#L18-L27\">it first tries to show suggestions from attached LSP clients</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/jasonxue1/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/jasonxue1\">@jasonxue1</a>, please read the help before asking questions.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">yeah, I’ve read that but I didn’t understand.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is my config file. What should be at the place circled?<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/103628493/418264390-f4375e28-104e-4f88-be23-b65f5cfdc50c.jpeg?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.._G9oYdOIwr9iNpwHTP2ZliBuRDurZWKHLBtwLDzA_NE\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/103628493/418264390-f4375e28-104e-4f88-be23-b65f5cfdc50c.jpeg?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.._G9oYdOIwr9iNpwHTP2ZliBuRDurZWKHLBtwLDzA_NE\" alt=\"776abd1d-2923-4c54-9e36-428f80293366\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>",
